Shmira companion
================

This app talks to the Headwind MDM agent through its plugin API. The two files

    app/src/main/aidl/com/hmdm/IMdmApi.aidl
    app/src/main/aidl/com/hmdm/IMdmApiCallback.aidl

are copied verbatim from the Headwind MDM Android agent (hmdm-android) and are
used under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

    http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Headwind MDM: Open Source Android Mobile Device Management Software
Project website: https://h-mdm.com
(c) 2019 Headwind Solutions LLC (http://www.h-sms.com)

Everything else under companion/ is part of the Shmira phone parental-control
system in this repository.
